{"chapter": "formal-defos", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "06JN", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{C}_\\Lambda$", "MATH_0003": "$x' \\to x$", "MATH_0004": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0005": "$A' \\to A$", "MATH_0006": "$$\n\\text{Aut}_{A'}(x') \\to \\text{Aut}_A(x).\n$$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\overline{\\mathcal{F}}$", "MATH_0009": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0010": "$\\overline{\\mathcal{F}}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-RS-associated-functor}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:e1fd3b1e14278c98e436a0d2cbd4148630962c6aa15bb30a6c9bc4c726d23664", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cb92c179ac971b51b74f66b10fce5b694b912bbfa8020638eb6352b90f1af1b4", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nLet <MATH_0001> be a category cofibered in groupoids over\n<MATH_0002>. Given a morphism <MATH_0003> in <MATH_0004> lying over\n<MATH_0005>, there is an induced homomorphism\n<MATH_0006>\nLemma <REF_0001>\nsays that the cokernel of this homomorphism determines whether\ncondition (RS) on <MATH_0007> passes to <MATH_0008>.\nIn this section we study the kernel of this homomorphism. We will see\nthat it also gives a measure of how far <MATH_0009>\nis from <MATH_0010>.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:54dda7deec9271558b0b83a65e6749f8a2b64456031ffb9a61eef3090174840e", "unit_id": "tag:06JN:prose-0001"}
